blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T11:03:12-08:00","id":1058481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1053779-what-to-get-my-future-niece-or-nephew?p=1058311#post1058311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Get them Vampire The Requiem 2nd Edition <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed, recent Gallop polls show that possibly less than 4% of babies play VtR:2E<br /> <br /> Although they can be a bit jaded to personal horror.<br /> <br /> The &quot;best&quot; thing in some ways, if nobody minds the loss in surprise, is simply to ask the parents about practical stuff they want and offer to buy an item or two (e.g. sterilizer).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T15:10:48-08:00","id":1058598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mangle77</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1053779-what-to-get-my-future-niece-or-nephew?p=1058355#post1058355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legos. Unopened Legos gain value faster than gold, and opened Legos are a great learning toy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you sure you don't want to save those for when they're old enough not to put random things in their mouth?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T16:12:48-08:00","id":1058630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1053779-what-to-get-my-future-niece-or-nephew?p=1058598#post1058598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you sure you don't want to save those for when they're old enough not to put random things in their mouth?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bWell, yeah! But they also make Duplo, which are Legos for toddlers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T17:17:24-08:00","id":1058681,"title":"","content":"Useful thing for the parents: <b><a href=\"http://www.toysrus.com/product/index.jsp?productId=70822536&amp;gclid=CjwKEAiAi-_FBRCZyPm_14CjoyASJAClUigOlPe-IGUnENUTuIFD6HUxgk-7c9AfXx6KFgxpm5eItxoCFc3w_wcB&amp;camp=PLAPPCG-_-PID22134999:BRUS&amp;cagpspn=plab_22134999&amp;eESource=CAPLA_DF:70822536:TRUS\" target=\"_blank\">Baby Bum Brush</a>.</b><br /> The ointment for diaper rash and irritation sticks to skin really well - which is good - but it's also a pain to scrub off your fingers with a wet wipe while trying to fasten the fresh diaper. <br /> <br /> I'm a librarian. At my weekly storytime for ages 3 and under, the bubble machine is everyone's favorite thing. We tried a few of the cheaper ones ($20-$30) that only lasted about two months. Finally, we invested in an expensive, non-battery powered one. We've had it for a year. It's still working great. It's expensive - about $100, but bubble machines entertain children from infancy to high school. If you really want to be the cool uncle, get a<b> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0061FSZZ0/ref=s9_acsd_al_bw_c_x_3_w\" target=\"_blank\">bubble machine</a>.</b><br /> <br /> Our DIY ball pit is also a bit hit. A cheap wading pool and a <b><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00PYLU3GG/ref=s9_acsd_top_hd_bw_bBGHhr_c_x_1_w?pf_rd_m=ATVPDKIKX0DER&amp;pf_rd_s=merchandised-search-3&amp;pf_rd_r=RDR2E6ZATH2G790M0GTW&amp;pf_rd_t=101&amp;pf_rd_p=02186195-81dc-5256-b791-eb3b2c411355&amp;pf_rd_i=166421011\" target=\"_blank\">bag of balls</a></b> can entertain and engage babies even when they're too small to sit up alone.<br /> <br /> Very young babies are easy to please, but here are some thing to avoid:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Foam blocks </b>- These collect dirt and grime. They're hard to clean, and once babies start teething, they can easily gnaw chunks off the soft blocks.</li> <li><b>Noisy Toys without a &quot;silent&quot; setting or instant off switch</b> - Nothing's worse than trying to stifle a singing bear that goes off just after you finally get a grumpy little one to sleep.</li> <li><b>Huge stuffed animals</b> - On top of being hard to clean, these take up a lot of space and after the initial &quot;wow&quot; reaction, aren't played with much.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12879-irenegrayle","name":"IreneGrayle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12879_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T08:09:53-08:00","id":1058997,"title":"","content":"I got one of these for my nephew for them to store his toys in and he loved it (and more importantly all his cousins were hella jealous) <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://www.inmyinterior.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/dumbo-baby-room-circus-tent.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> My sister swears by baby rockers, because sometimes that is the only way to get a newborn baby to take a nap so mommy can just SIT DOWN for five minutes <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://parentsneed.netcanyon.netdna-cdn.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Fisher-Price-Infant-To-Toddler-Rocker.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Barring that, another practical gift is lots of blankets, so they can cycle through all of them easily. When baby throws up on one, they can just switch it out with another one while the first goes into the wash. Which also brings to mind Baby Safe Laundry Detergent, the washer and dryer will be going nonstop at the house of a new baby, and they'll run through a staggering amount of soap. Regular Laundry Detergent is rough on a new kid's skin, but stuff made for babies is expensive. even buying them one unit a month is going to be a huge help if you want to go with long term gifts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-06T18:17:12-08:00","id":1059296,"title":"","content":"oh, any good books on promoting &quot;Peaceful parenting&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I dont want my niece or nephew to grow up to have a phobia of belts like me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop